.8'\n1185\t      - '17.2'\n1186\t      - '7.5'\n1187\t      - '17.6'\n1188\t    - - Mistral 7B\n1189\t      - Unc.\n1190\t      - '37.3'\n1191\t      - '63.9'\n1192\t      - '0'\n1193\t      - '0'\n1194\t      - '2.4'\n1195\t      - '0'\n1196\t    - - Mistral 7B\n1197\t      - Full S1\n1198\t      - '0'\n1199\t      - '0'\n1200\t      - '1.3'\n1201\t      - '14.9'\n1202\t      - '3.9'\n1203\t      - '11.7'\n1204\t    - - Mistral 7B\n1205\t      - Grammar\n1206\t      - '0'\n1207\t      - '64.0'\n1208\t      - '13.8'\n1209\t      - '1.1'\n1210\t      - '3.4'\n1211\t      - '11.9'\n1212\t  figures_description:\n1213\t  - 'Figure 1 (Intro/Method): Architecture diagram — ontology schema → compiler →\n1214\t    grammar CFG + semantic TypeConstraintProcessor → bitwise AND → constrained LLM\n1215\t    decoding。标注 enabling dependency arrow from grammar to semantic。'\n1216\t  - 'Figure 2 (§3 Violation Landscape): Heatmap of per-relation DR by model (SciERC\n1217\t    7 relations + DocRED top-10 relations)。Color intensity = violation rate，with tightness\n1218\t    τ̄ annotated per relation。'\n1219\t  - 'Figure 3 (§5 Results): DR reduction waterfall across settings (Unconstrained\n1220\t    → Grammar → Semantic → Full S1)，4-panel grid for SciERC/DocRED × Qwen/Llama。'\n1221\t  - 'Figure 4 (§5.4 EE): Stacked violation bar chart for WikiEvents (3 models × unc/grammar/S1)。Visual\n1222\t    dominance of RoV in unconstrained，clean elimination in Full S1。'\n1223\t  - 'Figure 5 (§5.5 or Appendix): Scale-neutral pattern plot — 8B vs 70B，DR and R-F1\n1224\t    delta，confirming model-size-invariance。'\n1225\t  analysis: Best tier paper 的 table/figure 密度目标是 ~1 table + ~1 figure per page (8\n1226\t    pages)。 4 tables + 5 figures = 9 visual elements 在 8 页正文中偏满——建议将 beam sweep 和\n1227\t    prompt sensitivity tables 移入 appendix，正文保留 3 tables + 4 figures。\n1228\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5cda2c76-b1bb-4b5e-b780-c4d3c1c78b32","uuid":"343e411d-f9a5-4a49-8aa9-b2e8302957a2","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:23:59.248Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T052642/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立——\"universal ontology-constrained structured generation\n  framework\"。 Paper story: violation landscape (empirical contribution #1) → composable\n  constraint compilation (methodological contribution #2) → RE 验证 (3 models × 2 datasets\n  × ZS+FT) + EE 跨任务泛化 + 70B scale generalization。Claims 无需降级。Title 保留 \"Type-Valid\n  IE via Compiled Ontology Constraints\"。 CF 写入 §7 limitation + beam search mitigation\n  写入 §5.5，不影响 core claim。Conference main 稳过。 70B LoRA 结果复现 8B LoRA 的 scale-neutral\n  模式：DR→近零、F1 中性/微正，confirming OntoCoDec 是 model-scale-invariant 的 plug-in infrastructure。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: WikiEvents Qwen3-8B unconstrained\n  plan_id: P021\n  description: WikiEvents event extraction, Qwen3-8B, unconstrained baseline. 246\n    docs.\n  expected_results:\n    parse_success_rate: 0.886\n    ET_pct: 0\n    EV_pct: 24.0\n    RoV_pct: 74.9\n    AC_pct: 0.3\n    CF_pct: 0\n    trigger_f1: 0.1184\n    argument_f1: 0.0009\n    entity_f1: 0\n  result_rationale: 'EV=24% 来自 Qwen 对 56 类 hierarchical event type 的部分幻觉（约 1/4 输出使用非法\n    event name）。 RoV=74.9% 是压倒性违规——80 个 argument roles conditioned on event type，zero-shot\n    模型几乎 随机选择 role names。Entity F1=0% 因为 unconstrained 输出不符合 schema JSON 格式，parser\n    无法 识别 entity mentions。AC 低(0.3%)因为大多数 argument 已经在 RoV 阶段被计为 invalid， 仅 role-valid\n    的 argument 才会被检查 AC。这些 baseline 数字建立了 EE 比 RE 更严峻的 violation landscape，为 two-layer\n    architecture 的必要性提供最强动机。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: WikiEvents ZS Violation Rates (3 Models)'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Qwen Unc.\n    - Qwen S1\n    - Llama Unc.\n    - Llama S1\n    - Mistral Unc.\n    - Mistral S1\n    rows:\n    - - Parse %\n      - '88.6'\n      - '83.7'\n      - '91.9'\n      - '84.1'\n      - '88.6'\n      - '88.6'\n    - - EV %\n      - '24.0'\n      - '0'\n      - '10.5'\n      - '0'\n      - '37.3'\n      - '0'\n    - - RoV %\n      - '74.9'\n      - '0'\n      - '88.8'\n      - '0'\n      - '63.9'\n      - '0'\n    - - AC %\n      - '0.3'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '3.8'\n      - '0'\n      - '1.3'\n    - - CF %\n      - '0'\n      - '21.1'\n      - '0'\n      - '17.2'\n      - '0'\n      - '14.9'\n    - - Trigger F1\n      - '11.8'\n      - '13.4'\n      - '5.7'\n      - '7.5'\n      - '2.4'\n      - '3.9'\n    - - Entity F1\n      - '0'\n      - '14.1'\n      - '0'\n      - '17.6'\n      - '0'\n      - '11.7'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: EV+RoV+AC per model, unconstrained vs constrained。视觉上 unconstrained\n    全是 violation（接近 100%），constrained 仅剩 AC 残余（1-4%），强烈对比。'\n  analysis: 'WikiEvents 的 violation landscape 比 RE 严峻一个数量级：RoV 64-89% vs RE 的 RV 1-30%。\n    这强化了 constraint decoding 在复杂 ontology 下的核心价值论证。Entity F1 从 0%→11-18% 不是 语义改进而是\n    format compliance 恢复——grammar 产出 schema-valid JSON，parser 才能识别 entities。 三模型一致的\n    EV/RoV→0% 确认 framework 跨任务泛化能力。\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained\n  plan_id: P023\n  description: WikiEvents event extraction, Llama-3.1-8B, unconstrained baseline.\n    246 docs.\n  expected_results:\n    parse_success_rate: 0.919\n    ET_pct: 0\n    EV_pct: 10.5\n    RoV_pct: 88.8\n    AC_pct: 0.1\n    CF_pct: 0\n    trigger_f1: 0.0572\n    argument_f1: 0\n    entity_f1: 0\n  result_rationale: 'Llama EV 最低(10.5%)说明其对 event type 名称的 memorization 更好（Llama 训练数据可能包含\n    更多 KAIROS-adjacent 文本）。但 RoV 最高(88.8%)，表明即便知道正确 event type，argument role 的 per-event-type\n    条件约束在 ZS 下几乎不可能满足。Trigger F1 5.7% 和 Arg F1 0% 确认 ZS EE 是极困难任务，F1 是控制变量而非优化目标。与\n    Qwen 的对比（EV 24% vs 10.5%，RoV 75% vs 89%） 证明不同 model family 的 failure mode 分布不同——进一步支持\n    model-agnostic constraint layer 的价值。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Llama 的 RoV=88.8% 是所有实验中最高的单项 violation rate，形成 compelling evidence：\n    即便是表现最好的模型（EV 仅 10.5%），在无约束下仍有近 90% 的 argument role 违规。 这个反直觉发现值得在 §5.4 重点强调。\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents Mistral-7B unconstrained\n  plan_id: P025\n  description: WikiEvents event extraction, Mistral-7B-v0.3, unconstrained baseline.\n    246 docs.\n  expected_results:\n    parse_success_rate: 0.789\n    ET_pct: 0\n    EV_pct: 37.3\n    RoV_pct: 63.9\n    AC_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0\n    trigger_f1: 0.0241\n    argument_f1: 0\n    entity_f1: 0\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral EV 最高(37.3%)——SentencePiece tokenizer(~32K vocab) 对长\n    hierarchical event names 的 tokenization 效率最低，更容易产生 OOV event types。RoV 相对最低(63.9%)可能是因为\n    Mistral 输出 fewer arguments overall（质量更低但 surface-level violation 更少）。AC=0% 因为\n    Mistral 基本不产出 entity type annotations（entity_f1=0%），没有可检查 AC 的 argument。 Parse\n    rate 最低(78.9%)反映 SentencePiece tokenizer 在 complex JSON 生成上的劣势。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '三模型的 violation 模式形成互补证据：Qwen 中等 EV + 高 RoV，Llama 低 EV + 极高 RoV， Mistral\n    高 EV + 中等 RoV。每个模型的 failure mode 分布不同，但 OntoCoDec 均实现 EV/RoV→0%——证明 framework\n    的 model-agnostic 特性。\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents Mistral grammar_only v3\n  plan_id: P027\n  description: Grammar-only ablation on Mistral WikiEvents — proves semantic layer\n    necessity for EE.\n  expected_results:\n    parse_success_rate: 0.886\n    ET_pct: 0\n    EV_pct: 0\n    RoV_pct: 64.0\n    AC_pct: 13.8\n    CF_pct: 1.1\n    entity_f1: 0.1192\n    trigger_f1: 0.0337\n    argument_f1: 0.0027\n  result_rationale: 'Grammar-only 消除 EV→0%（CFG 约束 event type vocabulary 是 context-free\n    的），但 RoV 仍有 64%——因为 argument role 的合法性取决于所在 event type（per-event-type conditional\n    constraint）， 这是 context-sensitive 的，CFG 无法表达。AC 从 0%→13.8% 是 latent violation\n    surfacing： grammar 强制产出有效 role names 后，这些 role 对应的 entity type 约束才能被检查，暴露 先前被\n    RoV 掩盖的 AC violations。这与 RE 中 DocRED grammar_only DR=26.17%（latent DR surfacing）模式完全一致——是\n    two-layer architecture 必要性的关键 ablation 证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: WikiEvents Grammar-Only Ablation (Mistral)'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Unconstrained\n    - Grammar-Only\n    - Full S1\n    rows:\n    - - EV %\n      - '37.3'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n    - - RoV %\n      - '63.9'\n      - '64.0'\n      - '0'\n    - - AC %\n      - '0'\n      - '13.8'\n      - '1.3'\n    - - CF %\n      - '0'\n      - '1.1'\n      - '14.9'\n    - - Entity F1\n      - '0'\n      - '11.9'\n      - '11.7'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-panel waterfall showing constraint layers progressively reducing violations:\n    Unconstrained → Grammar-Only → Full S1。EV 在第一步消除，RoV 在第二步消除，AC surfacing 在第二步后暴露。'\n  analysis: 'Grammar-only ablation 是论文最重要的 EE 证据之一。它证明：(1) grammar 层对 EE 的 EV 同样有效，(2)\n    RoV 无法被 grammar 约束——需要 semantic layer，(3) AC surfacing 模式与 RE 中 DR surfacing 一致——同一\n    latent violation 机制跨任务复现。结论：two-layer architecture 不是便利选择而是 necessary decomposition。\n\n    '\n- name: WikiEvents EE post-hoc filtering (3 models)\n  plan_id: P028\n  description: Post-hoc filtering baseline for EE — demonstrates infeasibility of\n    filter-based approach for complex IE tasks.\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_args_before: 5467\n    qwen_args_after: 23\n    qwen_discard_rate: 0.996\n    llama_args_before: 5053\n    llama_args_after: 3\n    llama_discard_rate: 0.999\n    mistral_args_before: 6034\n    mistral_args_after: 0\n    mistral_discard_rate: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'Post-hoc filtering 在 EE 上彻底失败——因为 RoV 64-89% + EV 10-37% 的累积\n    violation rate 远超 RE 的 15-26%。RE 中 post-hoc 尚可保留 52-84% triples，但 EE 中 99.6-100%\n    的 arguments 被丢弃。这是因为 EE 的约束层级更深（EV→RoV→AC 三级联，任何一级违规就被过滤）， 而 RE 仅有 DR 一级主要约束。Mistral\n    100% discard 是极端案例：EV=37.3% 的 event type 已经不在 ontology 中，其下所有 arguments 自动 invalid。\n    这个结果使 post-hoc 在 EE 场景下完全不可行——构成 decoding-time enforcement 的最强 motivation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Post-hoc Filtering Feasibility (RE vs EE)'\n    columns:\n    - Setting\n    - Dataset\n    - Discard Rate %\n    - Viable?\n    rows:\n    - - RE ZS\n      - SciERC (Qwen)\n      - '16.8'\n      - Yes (costly)\n    - - RE ZS\n      - DocRED (Qwen)\n      - '48.1'\n      - Marginal\n    - - RE ZS\n      - DocRED (Mistral)\n      - '73.7'\n      - 'No'\n    - - EE ZS\n      - WikiEvents (Qwen)\n      - '99.6'\n      - 'No'\n    - - EE ZS\n      - WikiEvents (Llama)\n      - '99.9'\n      - 'No'\n    - - EE ZS\n      - WikiEvents (Mistral)\n      - '100.0'\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: discard rate across RE/EE datasets, 按严重程度排列，显示从 16.8%→100% 的 escalation。视觉上\n    EE 部分完全是黑色（discarded），与 RE 形成鲜明对比。'\n  analysis: 'Post-hoc 在 EE 的 devastating failure 是论文叙事的关键转折点。RE 中 post-hoc 尚可作为 \"expensive\n    but functional\" baseline，但 EE 中其彻底崩溃证明：随 ontology 复杂度增加， post-hoc 的 scalability\n    是 O(violations^layers)——每增加一个约束层级，discard rate 指数增长。这为 decoding-time enforcement\n    建立了不可替代的 positioning。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained\n  plan_id: P029\n  description: Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 on SciERC, zero-shot. Scale dimension\n    (8B→70B).\n  expected_results:\n    unconstrained:\n      DR_pct: 6.5\n      RV_pct: 0.6\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 0\n      E_F1: 35.17\n      R_F1: 11.22\n    constrained:\n      DR_pct: 0\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 3.66\n      E_F1: 35.14\n      R_F1: 11.24\n    delta_DR_pp: -6.5\n    delta_R_F1_pp: 0.02\n    DR_reduction_pct: 100\n  result_rationale: '70B ZS 在 SciERC 上实现 DR=0%（完全消除），远超 8B 的 DR≈0.08-0.93%。这是因为： (1)\n    70B 的 baseline DR 仅 6.5%（8B 为 13-15%），更少的 violations 意味着更少的 fallback events，semantic\n    mask 覆盖率更高；(2) SciERC 7-relation ontology 约束空间小， semantic mask 几乎不产生空交集。R_F1 delta\n    +0.02pp 是 F1-neutral 的理想结果。 CF=3.66% 低于 8B Qwen 的 9.9%（70B 对 entity type 的一致性更好），但仍非零——\n    确认 CF 是方法论固有限制而非小模型特有问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 70B ZS Results (SciERC + DocRED)'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Setting\n    - DR %\n    - RV %\n    - ET %\n    - CF %\n    - R-F1 %\n    - E-F1 %\n    rows:\n    - - SciERC\n      - Unc.\n      - '6.5'\n      - '0.6'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '11.22'\n      - '35.17'\n    - - SciERC\n      - S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '3.66'\n      - '11.24'\n      - '35.14'\n    - - DocRED\n      - Unc.\n      - '15.0'\n      - '7.8'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '13.03'\n      - '69.03'\n    - - DocRED\n      - S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '7.01'\n      - '13.07'\n      - '69.05'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '70B ZS 在两个 RE 数据集上均实现 DR=0%，R-F1 完全中性——这是最干净的 scale generalization 证据。与\n    8B ZS 的 DR 0.08-10.21% 相比，70B 的更低 baseline violations 使 OntoCoDec 更容易 实现完全消除。关键\n    insight：constraint effectiveness 与 model scale 正相关（更好的模型 → 更少 baseline violations\n    → 更少 fallback → 更高 semantic coverage → DR→0%）。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained\n  plan_id: P030\n  description: Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4 on DocRED, zero-shot. Scale dimension.\n  expected_results:\n    unconstrained:\n      DR_pct: 15.0\n      RV_pct: 7.8\n      ET_pct: 0.02\n      CF_pct: 0.07\n      E_F1: 69.03\n      R_F1: 13.03\n    constrained:\n      DR_pct: 0\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 7.01\n      E_F1: 69.05\n      R_F1: 13.07\n    delta_DR_pp: -15.0\n    delta_R_F1_pp: 0.04\n    DR_reduction_pct: 100\n  result_rationale: '70B 在 DocRED 96-relation ontology 上也实现 DR=0%，是整个实验矩阵中最难的 ZS 配置\n    （ontology 最大 × 模型最大）。8B Qwen 在 DocRED 仅达 DR↓45%（残余 10.21%），8B Llama DR↓90%（残余\n    2.55%）——70B 一步到位 DR=0%，验证了 constraint tightness × model baseline 的 dual-factor\n    理论：70B 的 RV=7.8%（远低于 Qwen 29.66%）意味着 grammar 层几乎不需要 强制纠正 relation names，semantic\n    层面对的都是 legitimate relation types，constraint coverage 因此接近 100%。CF=7.01% 与 8B Llama(12.02%)\n    和 8B Qwen(2.57%) 处于中间水平。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '70B DocRED DR=0% 是实验矩阵中最关键的数据点之一。它解决了 paper 长期面临的 \"DocRED DR 残余\" 问题——不是方法论缺陷，而是小模型\n    baseline violation rate 过高导致 fallback 频繁。R-F1 delta +0.04pp 与 SciERC 的 +0.02pp\n    一致：scale up 后 F1 影响完全中性。\n\n    '\n- name: Error analysis / case study\n  plan_id: P031\n  description: 10-20 representative cases from v3 EE results — AC residual analysis,\n    CF root causes, qualitative evidence.\n  expected_results:\n    ac_residual_cases: 8\n    ac_root_cause_semantic_confusion: 6\n    ac_root_cause_bpe_collision: 2\n    cf_root_cause_type_ambiguity: 7\n    cf_root_cause_event_complexity: 3\n    qualitative_constraint_save_cases: 5\n  result_rationale: 'AC 残余（1.3-3.8%）的主要来源是语义混淆（如 SideOfConflict vs SentencedPerson，两者共享\n    \"参与冲突\" 的语义空间）——这是 entity type ontology 的固有模糊性，非方法缺陷。Mistral 有 2 个 BPE collision\n    残余案例（SID/SEN/SIDE→''S''），但 collision fix 已将 AC 从 16.6%→1.3%。 CF 根因分析将揭示 EE 的 CF\n    比 RE 更高（15-21% vs 10%）是因为 argument structure 更复杂—— 同一 entity 可能在同一文档的不同 events\n    中扮演不同角色（如 \"Iran\" 在 Attack 事件中是 Attacker(GPE) 而在 Sanction 事件中是 Target(ORG)），type\n    assignment 本质上 event-dependent。 Qualitative \"constraint save\" 案例展示 OntoCoDec 将\n    hallucinated event types 重定向到 语义最近的合法 type，保留信息提取的实质内容。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Case study figure: 2-3 个并排案例，左侧 unconstrained 输出（红色标注 violations），右侧 constrained\n    输出（绿色标注 corrections）。展示 grammar 层修正 event type + semantic 层修正 argument role 的联合效果。'\n  analysis: 'Error analysis 为 paper 提供 qualitative depth。AC 残余的 semantic confusion\n    根因分析 证明这不是 engineering bug 而是 ontology design limitation——future work 可通过 entity\n    type hierarchy（如 Person 子类型细分）减少混淆。CF 的 event-dependent type assignment 分析首次系统性解释了为什么\n    EE 的 CF 高于 RE——argument 结构复杂度是根因。\n\n    '\n- name: EE FT composability\n  plan_id: P032\n  description: Fine-tuned model + OntoCoDec composability test on WikiEvents EE.\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_ft:\n      unconstrained_parse_rate: 0.85\n      unconstrained_trigger_f1: 0.3208\n      unconstrained_arg_f1: 0.0785\n      unconstrained_rov: 0.3831\n      unconstrained_ac: 0.0268\n      constrained_parse_rate: 0.95\n      constrained_trigger_f1: 0.2672\n      constrained_arg_f1: 0.0818\n      constrained_rov: 0\n      constrained_ac: 0\n    llama_ft:\n      unconstrained_trigger_f1: 0.2752\n      unconstrained_arg_f1: 0.0998\n      unconstrained_rov: 0.088\n      unconstrained_ac: 0.035\n      constrained_trigger_f1: 0.2691\n      constrained_arg_f1: 0.0891\n      constrained_rov: 0\n      constrained_ac: 0.008\n  result_rationale: 'EE FT composability 结果与 RE FT 模式一致：LoRA fine-tuning 大幅降低 baseline\n    violations （Qwen RoV 74.9%→38.3%，Llama RoV 88.8%→8.8%），OntoCoDec 进一步消除至 0%。 关键发现：(1)\n    Llama FT 的 RoV 降幅更大（从 88.8%→8.8%，91% 削减），说明 Llama 对 WikiEvents schema 的 LoRA 学习效率更高；(2)\n    即便 FT 后，Qwen 仍有 38.3% RoV—— FT 无法完全解决 role constraint，OntoCoDec 仍有不可替代的价值；(3)\n    Arg F1 在 constrained 下微升（Qwen +0.33pp, Llama 微降 -1.07pp），确认 FT+constrained 的 composability\n    在 EE 上同样成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: EE FT Composability (Qwen + Llama)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Setting\n    - RoV %\n    - AC %\n    - Trigger F1\n    - Arg F1\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen FT\n      - Unc.\n      - '38.3'\n      - '2.7'\n      - '32.1'\n      - '7.9'\n    - - Qwen FT\n      - S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '26.7'\n      - '8.2'\n    - - Llama FT\n      - Unc.\n      - '8.8'\n      - '3.5'\n      - '27.5'\n      - '10.0'\n    - - Llama FT\n      - S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '26.9'\n      - '8.9'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'EE FT composability 完成了 \"ZS composability (RE) → FT composability (RE)\n    → ZS generalization (EE) → FT composability (EE)\" 的完整证据链。四个 quadrant 全部验证：OntoCoDec\n    在任何 task × training regime 组合下都能即插即用地消除 violations。 这是 \"universal framework\" claim\n    的最强支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\n  plan_id: P033\n  description: Grammar-only ablation on Qwen/Llama WikiEvents EE for completeness\n    — extends Mistral-only ablation.\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_grammar_only:\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 68.0\n      AC_pct: 9.5\n      CF_pct: 0.8\n      entity_f1: 0.14\n      trigger_f1: 0.12\n    llama_grammar_only:\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 77.0\n      AC_pct: 12.0\n      CF_pct: 0.5\n      entity_f1: 0.17\n      trigger_f1: 0.06\n  result_rationale: '预测基于 Mistral grammar_only 模式 + cross-model violation 基线差异。Qwen\n    grammar_only RoV≈68%（vs Mistral 64%）略高因为 Qwen unconstrained RoV=74.9% 本身更高，grammar\n    层 不改变 role generation pattern。Llama grammar_only RoV≈77%（vs 其 unconstrained 88.8%）——\n    grammar 层通过消除 OOV event types 间接减少了约 12pp RoV（部分 role violations 源于 hallucinated\n    event types 下不存在的 roles）。AC surfacing pattern 在三个模型上一致： grammar_only AC=9-14%\n    vs unconstrained AC=0-0.3%，确认 latent violation surfacing 是 model-agnostic 的架构特性。这三个模型的\n    grammar_only 消融证据足以支持论文 §5.4 中 \"grammar layer necessary but insufficient for EE\"\n    的 claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Grammar-Only Ablation Across Models (WikiEvents)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - EV %\n    - RoV %\n    - AC %\n    - CF %\n    rows:\n    - - Mistral Unc.\n      - '37.3'\n      - '63.9'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n    - - Mistral Grammar\n      - '0'\n      - '64.0'\n      - '13.8'\n      - '1.1'\n    - - Mistral Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '1.3'\n      - '14.9'\n    - - Qwen Unc.\n      - '24.0'\n      - '74.9'\n      - '0.3'\n      - '0'\n    - - Qwen Grammar*\n      - '0'\n      - '68.0'\n      - '9.5'\n      - '0.8'\n    - - Qwen Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '21.1'\n    - - Llama Unc.\n      - '10.5'\n      - '88.8'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '0'\n    - - Llama Grammar*\n      - '0'\n      - '77.0'\n      - '12.0'\n      - '0.5'\n    - - Llama Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '3.8'\n      - '17.2'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Tier 3 优先级——Mistral grammar_only 已足够支撑论文 claim。如果 GPU 时间允许， Qwen/Llama\n    grammar_only 为 appendix 完整性提供价值，但不影响核心叙事。 三模型一致的 AC surfacing 模式是 bonus finding。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\n  plan_id: P034\n  description: Statistical significance testing for WikiEvents EE metric changes.\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_trigger_f1_delta: 1.55\n    qwen_trigger_f1_p: 0.02\n    qwen_entity_f1_delta: 14.09\n    qwen_entity_f1_p: <0.001\n    llama_trigger_f1_delta: 1.76\n    llama_trigger_f1_p: 0.03\n    llama_entity_f1_delta: 17.63\n    llama_entity_f1_p: <0.001\n    mistral_trigger_f1_delta: 1.46\n    mistral_trigger_f1_p: 0.05\n    mistral_entity_f1_delta: 11.71\n    mistral_entity_f1_p: <0.001\n  result_rationale: 'Entity F1 的 0%→11-18% 跳跃在统计上必然显著（p<0.001）——这是 floor-to-nonzero\n    的 结构性变化，bootstrap 的每个 resample 都会反映这一模式。Trigger F1 的 +1.5-1.8pp 变化相对较小（基线 2.4-11.8%），在\n    246 docs 样本下 p-values 预计在 0.02-0.05 范围—— borderline significant。但论文不需要 trigger\n    F1 的显著性作为 core claim，因为 contribution 是 violation elimination 而非 F1 improvement。Entity\n    F1 significance 足以在 appendix 中报告。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Bootstrap CI 为 EE 结果提供 statistical rigor，但在 best tier 叙事下不是关键—— EV/RoV→0%\n    的 exact match 不需要 CI，这些是确定性消除。CI 主要用于 F1 metrics， 且 Entity F1 的 floor-to-nonzero\n    变化 trivially significant。放入 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: Latency overhead measurement\n  plan_id: P035\n  description: 'Wall-clock comparison: unconstrained vs constrained decoding overhead\n    across tasks.'\n  expected_results:\n    re_zs_scierc_overhead_pct: 13.1\n    re_ft_scierc_overhead_pct: 10.0\n    re_zs_scierc_mean_s: 4.71\n    re_ft_scierc_mean_s: 2.873\n    ee_zs_wikievents_overhead_pct: 18.0\n    ee_zs_wikievents_mean_s: 12.5\n    beam4_overhead_pct: 16.5\n    beam4_mean_s: 4.013\n  result_rationale: 'RE ZS/FT latency已有实测数据（13.1%/10%）。EE latency预测~18%——高于 RE 的 13%\n    因为： (1) WikiEvents ontology 更大（56 event types × 80 roles vs SciERC 7 relations），\n    semantic mask computation 更重；(2) JSON 结构更深（events 内嵌 arguments 内嵌 entities）， 更多\n    token positions 需要 mask 计算；(3) 但 absolute overhead 仍远低于 2× threshold， 属于 practical\n    deployment 可接受范围。Beam search 的 16.5% constraint overhead 与 greedy 13.1% 接近——beam\n    本身的多路扩展已 dominate latency，constraint 的增量开销 被 amortize。所有配置均在 1.2× 以下，不构成 deployment\n    blocker。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Latency Overhead Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Setting\n    - Unc. (s/doc)\n    - Con. (s/doc)\n    - Overhead %\n    rows:\n    - - RE ZS SciERC (8B)\n      - '4.16'\n      - '4.71'\n      - '13.1'\n    - - RE FT SciERC (8B)\n      - '2.61'\n      - '2.87'\n      - '10.0'\n    - - RE FT SciERC Beam-4 (8B)\n      - '3.45'\n      - '4.01'\n      - '16.5'\n    - - EE ZS WikiEvents (8B)*\n      - '10.6'\n      - '12.5'\n      - ~18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: latency overhead percentage across settings, with 20% threshold line。所有\n    bars 在 threshold 以下，视觉上证明 practical deployability。'\n  analysis: 'Latency overhead 10-18% 在所有配置下均可接受。关键论点：相比 post-hoc filtering 需要额外 pipeline\n    stage + re-extraction cycle，OntoCoDec 的 single-pass overhead 在 engineering 上更优。EE\n    的 18% overhead 是 worst case，仍远低于 2× boundary。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA SciERC unconstrained eval\n  plan_id: R16-LoRA-SciERC-Unc\n  description: 'Llama-3.1-70B-AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned on SciERC train set (3 epochs,\n    checkpoint-663), unconstrained greedy eval on SciERC test (551 docs). Baseline\n    for constrained comparison.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    DR_pct: 0.8\n    RV_pct: 0\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0\n    E_F1: 69.5\n    E_P: 68.0\n    E_R: 71.1\n    R_F1: 48.2\n    R_P: 44.8\n    R_R: 52.3\n    parse_fail_pct: 0\n    total_samples: 551\n  result_rationale: '8B LoRA baselines: Qwen DR=1.95%, R_F1=43.86%; Llama DR=1.11%,\n    R_F1=45.45%。 70B LoRA 预期 DR~0.8%——低于 8B 因为 70B 的 larger capacity 使 LoRA training\n    对 ontology constraints 的学习更充分（eval_loss 0.0611 与 8B 的 0.0586-0.0595 接近， 但 70B\n    基座本身更强）。R_F1~48.2% 高于 8B 的 43-45%，但提升幅度不大（~3-5pp）—— SciERC 是小数据集（551 test, ~1.7K\n    relations），LoRA 已经 saturate 了大部分 learnable signal，scale 的 marginal gain 有限。E_F1~69.5%\n    略高于 8B 的 67-68%。 RV/ET=0% 因为 LoRA training 已完全学会 SciERC 的 7 个 relation name 和\n    6 个 entity type。 CF=0% 与 8B unconstrained 一致（无 semantic enforcement 时 CF 来自 model\n    自身一致性）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '70B LoRA unconstrained 的 DR=0.8% 确认 LoRA training 在 70B 上同样有效地降低 baseline\n    violations（从 ZS 6.5%→LoRA 0.8%，↓88%）。R_F1 48.2% 预期为 cross-model 最高——为 \"OntoCoDec\n    composable with best available models\" claim 提供 upper-bound 证据。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA SciERC constrained eval (Full S1)\n  plan_id: R16-LoRA-SciERC-S1\n  description: 'Same 70B LoRA model, Full S1 constrained decoding on SciERC test (551\n    docs). Best tier target: DR≤0.1%, |ΔR-F1|≤0.3pp.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    DR_pct: 0.05\n    RV_pct: 0\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0.6\n    E_F1: 69.5\n    E_P: 68.0\n    E_R: 71.1\n    R_F1: 48.3\n    R_P: 44.9\n    R_R: 52.3\n    parse_fail_pct: 0\n    total_samples: 551\n    delta_vs_unconstrained:\n      DR_delta_pp: -0.75\n      R_F1_delta_pp: 0.1\n      E_F1_delta_pp: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'DR 0.8%→0.05%：70B LoRA 的 baseline DR 已极低，S1 仅需处理少量残余 violations。\n    参考 8B patterns——Qwen LoRA DR 1.95%→0%, Llama LoRA 1.11%→0.09%。70B LoRA 的 baseline\n    更低（0.8%），constrained 后 DR~0.05% 合理（可能有 1-2 个 edge case triple 因 fallback 未被 semantic\n    mask 覆盖）。\n\n    R_F1 delta +0.1pp：与 8B Llama LoRA 的 +0.02pp 一致，在 F1-neutral 范围内。 LoRA 模型的 baseline\n    RV 已经≈0%，grammar 层对 F1 无贡献；semantic 层的 DR reduction 也不改变 F1（正确 triples 的 type\n    本就合法）。因此 F1 delta 应极小。\n\n    CF 0%→0.6%：与 8B Qwen LoRA 的 0%→1.18% 和 Llama LoRA 的 0%→0.46% 一致。 70B 的 CF 可能略低于\n    8B Qwen 但略高于 8B Llama——取 0.6% 作为中间值。\n\n    这些数字完美落入 best tier ranges: DR 0.05% ∈ [0, 0.1]✓, ΔR-F1 +0.1pp ∈ [-0.3, 0.3]✓。\n    Scale-neutral pattern confirmed：70B LoRA 复现了 8B LoRA 的 \"DR→near-zero, F1-neutral\"\n    行为。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LoRA Constrained Decoding Across Scales (SciERC)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - DR Unc. %\n    - DR S1 %\n    - DR Red. %\n    - R-F1 Unc.\n    - R-F1 S1\n    - Delta R-F1 pp\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - '1.95'\n      - '0'\n      - '100'\n      - '43.86'\n      - '43.77'\n      - '-0.09'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - '1.11'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '91.9'\n      - '45.45'\n      - '45.47'\n      - '+0.02'\n    - - Llama 70B*\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '93.8'\n      - '48.2'\n      - '48.3'\n      - '+0.1'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scale-neutral pattern chart: x-axis = model size (8B Qwen, 8B Llama, 70B Llama),\n    y-axis = DR% (左轴, log scale) + R-F1 delta (右轴)。DR 在所有 scales 上→near-zero，R-F1\n    delta 在 ±0.3pp band 内。Visual message: OntoCoDec is scale-invariant。'\n  analysis: '70B LoRA SciERC constrained eval 是 best tier 的 make-or-break 数据点。DR≤0.1%\n    和 |ΔR-F1|≤0.3pp 的预期基于三条证据线的收敛：(1) 8B Qwen/Llama LoRA 均在此范围内， (2) 70B ZS 已达 DR=0%，(3)\n    eval_loss 0.0611 与 8B 可比。唯一风险是 AWQ-INT4 量化 引入微小的 logit distortion 使个别 edge case\n    的 semantic mask 不生效——但 8B 未使用 量化也有残余 DR，故此风险不大。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA DocRED unconstrained eval (200-doc)\n  plan_id: R16-LoRA-DocRED-Unc\n  description: 'Llama-3.1-70B-AWQ-INT4 LoRA fine-tuned on DocRED train set (3 epochs,\n    checkpoint-1146), unconstrained greedy eval on DocRED dev 200-doc subset. Per\n    D082 decision.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    DR_pct: 0.4\n    RV_pct: 0.05\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0.1\n    E_F1: 86.0\n    E_P: 86.5\n    E_R: 85.5\n    R_F1: 46.5\n    R_P: 42.0\n    R_R: 52.0\n    parse_fail_pct: 1.5\n    total_samples: 200\n  result_rationale: '8B LoRA DocRED baselines: Qwen DR=0.76%, R_F1=40.86%; Llama DR=0.49%,\n    R_F1=43.72%。 70B LoRA 预期 DR~0.4%——略低于 8B Llama 的 0.49%，因为 70B 对 DocRED 96 relations\n    的学习更充分（eval_loss 0.0635 vs 8B Llama 0.0624，接近但 70B 基座更强）。 R_F1~46.5% 高于 8B Llama\n    43.72%，提升 ~3pp——与 SciERC 上的 scale gain 一致。 E_F1~86% 高于 8B Llama 83.93%，70B 对 entity\n    mention detection 的改善更明显 （DocRED entity extraction 更复杂，benefit from larger model\n    capacity）。 RV~0.05%（而非 0%）因为 DocRED 96 relations 中可能有 1-2 个 long-tail relation\n    在 training data 中出现极少，70B LoRA 偶尔 hallucinate 接近但不完全匹配的 name。 200-doc subset per\n    D082——足以建立 scale trend，不需要 998 全量。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '200-doc subset 的统计功效：假设 DR σ≈0.3pp（基于 8B seed variance），200 docs 给出 95%\n    CI ≈ ±0.04pp，足以确认 DR<0.5%。R_F1 的 95% CI ≈ ±1.5pp，足以区分 vs 8B baseline。Scale gain\n    ~3pp R_F1 与 SciERC 一致——confirmation of scale trend。\n\n    '\n- name: 70B LoRA DocRED constrained eval (200-doc, Full S1)\n  plan_id: R16-LoRA-DocRED-S1\n  description: 'Same 70B LoRA model, Full S1 constrained decoding on DocRED dev 200-doc\n    subset. Best tier target: DR≤0.2%, |ΔR-F1|≤0.5pp.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    DR_pct: 0.08\n    RV_pct: 0\n    ET_pct: 0\n    CF_pct: 0.3\n    E_F1: 86.0\n    E_P: 86.5\n    E_R: 85.5\n    R_F1: 46.6\n    R_P: 42.1\n    R_R: 52.1\n    parse_fail_pct: 1.5\n    total_samples: 200\n    delta_vs_unconstrained:\n      DR_delta_pp: -0.32\n      R_F1_delta_pp: 0.1\n      E_F1_delta_pp: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'DR 0.4%→0.08%：DocRED 96-relation ontology 的 constraint space\n    比 SciERC 更大， fallback frequency 相应更高（cf. 8B Qwen DocRED fallback 57次/doc vs SciERC\n    11次/doc）。 但 70B LoRA 的 baseline RV≈0.05%（远低于 8B ZS Qwen 的 29.66%），grammar-semantic\n    mask 交集几乎不为空，因此 fallback 率极低。预期 DR~0.08%（200 docs 上大约 1-2 个 residual violation\n    triple），远在 best tier 0.2% 阈值内。\n\n    R_F1 delta +0.1pp：与 8B Llama LoRA 的 +0.06pp 一致。70B LoRA 的 RV 已极低， grammar 层几乎不改变\n    prediction distribution；semantic 层的 DR reduction 也 不影响 F1（被纠正的 triples 大多本就是 FP）。F1\n    delta 在 ±0.2pp 内是高置信度预期。\n\n    CF 0.1%→0.3%：DocRED LoRA 的 CF 整体较低（8B Llama 0.21%, Qwen 0.41%）。 70B 的 CF 预期在此范围内。CF\n    增量 0.2pp 远小于 ZS 场景（ZS 70B CF=7.01%）—— LoRA training 显著减少了 entity type inconsistency。\n\n    Best tier alignment: DR 0.08% ∈ [0, 0.2]✓, ΔR-F1 +0.1pp ∈ [-0.5, 0.5]✓。 Scale-neutral\n    pattern 在 DocRED 上同样成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: LoRA Constrained Decoding Across Scales (DocRED)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - DR Unc. %\n    - DR S1 %\n    - DR Red. %\n    - R-F1 Unc.\n    - R-F1 S1\n    - Delta R-F1 pp\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen 8B (998d)\n      - '0.76'\n      - '0.01'\n      - '98.7'\n      - '40.86'\n      - '40.56'\n      - '-0.30'\n    - - Llama 8B (998d)\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '57.1'\n      - '43.72'\n      - '43.78'\n      - '+0.06'\n    - - Llama 70B (200d)*\n      - '0.4'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '80.0'\n      - '46.5'\n      - '46.6'\n      - '+0.1'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: SciERC + DocRED side-by-side, 8B vs 70B LoRA, DR 和 R-F1 delta。两个数据集上\n    70B 均在 best tier target zone 内。'\n  analysis: '70B LoRA DocRED 是 best tier 的第二个关键数据点。200-doc subset 的选择（D082） 是 pragmatic——998-doc\n    全量需要 ~15 小时（87s/sample × 998），200-doc 4 小时可完成。 统计功效足以确认 DR<0.2% 和 |ΔR-F1|<0.5pp。如果\n    200-doc 结果 clean，可在 paper 中报告并注明 sample size，同时在 appendix 讨论 full-set extrapolation。\n\n    '\n- name: Consolidated Results — Best Tier Paper Tables\n  plan_id: SUMMARY\n  description: All planned experiments consolidated into paper-ready tables.\n  expected_results:\n    total_experiment_configs: 45\n    models_tested: 4\n    datasets: 3\n    tasks: 2\n    scales: 2\n    training_regimes: 2\n  result_rationale: 'Best tier paper 需要 4 个核心 tables：(1) RE main results（3 models\n    × 2 datasets × ZS unconstrained/constrained），(2) RE LoRA results（3 models × 2\n    datasets，含 70B）， (3) WikiEvents EE results（3 models × unconstrained/constrained\n    + grammar_only ablation）， (4) 70B scale generalization summary（ZS + LoRA，SciERC\n    + DocRED）。这四个 tables 覆盖论文的全部 empirical claims。Appendix 另有 beam sweep、prompt sensitivity、\n    latency、seed variance、post-hoc comparison 等补充 tables。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Paper Table 1: RE Zero-Shot Main Results'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Dataset\n    - Setting\n    - DR %\n    - RV %\n    - ET %\n    - CF %\n    - R-F1 %\n    - E-F1 %\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - SciERC\n      - Unc.\n      - '15.37'\n      - '1.39'\n      - '0.40'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '8.23'\n      - '31.01'\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - SciERC\n      - Full S1\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '9.90'\n      - '8.36'\n      - '30.98'\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - DocRED\n      - Unc.\n      - '18.46'\n      - '29.66'\n      - '2.48'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '7.74'\n      - '58.15'\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - DocRED\n      - Full S1\n      - '10.21'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0'\n      - '2.57'\n      - '8.23'\n      - '59.37'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - SciERC\n      - Unc.\n      - '13.34'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.24'\n      - '2.68'\n      - '23.56'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - SciERC\n      - Full S1\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '6.56'\n      - '2.54'\n      - '23.49'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - DocRED\n      - Unc.\n      - '26.07'\n      - '16.03'\n      - '0.13'\n      - '0.17'\n      - '5.98'\n      - '55.65'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - DocRED\n      - Full S1\n      - '2.55'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '12.02'\n      - '6.27'\n      - '55.01'\n    - - Mistral 7B\n      - SciERC\n      - Unc.\n      - '56.94'\n      - '0'\n      - '1.50'\n      - '56.87'\n      - '3.66'\n      - '27.28'\n    - - Mistral 7B\n      - SciERC\n      - Full S1\n      - '13.40'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '1.27'\n      - '3.67'\n      - '27.46'\n    - - Mistral 7B\n      - DocRED\n      - Unc.\n      - '57.42'\n      - '42.35'\n      - '7.58'\n      - '24.78'\n      - '4.34'\n      - '48.51'\n    - - Mistral 7B\n      - DocRED\n      - Full S1\n      - '33.20'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '0.19'\n      - '5.52'\n      - '50.59'\n    - - Llama 70B\n      - SciERC\n      - Unc.\n      - '6.50'\n      - '0.60'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '11.22'\n      - '35.17'\n    - - Llama 70B\n      - SciERC\n      - Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '3.66'\n      - '11.24'\n      - '35.14'\n    - - Llama 70B\n      - DocRED\n      - Unc.\n      - '15.00'\n      - '7.80'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '13.03'\n      - '69.03'\n    - - Llama 70B\n      - DocRED\n      - Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '7.01'\n      - '13.07'\n      - '69.05'\n  - name: 'Paper Table 2: LoRA Fine-Tuned + Constrained (Scale Comparison)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Dataset\n    - N docs\n    - DR Unc. %\n    - DR S1 %\n    - R-F1 Unc.\n    - R-F1 S1\n    - Delta R-F1 pp\n    - CF S1 %\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - SciERC\n      - '551'\n      - '1.95'\n      - '0'\n      - '43.86'\n      - '43.77'\n      - '-0.09'\n      - '1.18'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - SciERC\n      - '551'\n      - '1.11'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '45.45'\n      - '45.47'\n      - '+0.02'\n      - '0.46'\n    - - Llama 70B*\n      - SciERC\n      - '551'\n      - '0.8'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '48.2'\n      - '48.3'\n      - '+0.1'\n      - '0.6'\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - DocRED\n      - '998'\n      - '0.76'\n      - '0.01'\n      - '40.86'\n      - '40.56'\n      - '-0.30'\n      - '0.41'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - DocRED\n      - '998'\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '43.72'\n      - '43.78'\n      - '+0.06'\n      - '0.21'\n    - - Llama 70B*\n      - DocRED\n      - '200'\n      - '0.4'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '46.5'\n      - '46.6'\n      - '+0.1'\n      - '0.3'\n  - name: 'Paper Table 3: WikiEvents Event Extraction (ZS)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Setting\n    - EV %\n    - RoV %\n    - AC %\n    - CF %\n    - Trig-F1 %\n    - Ent-F1 %\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - Unc.\n      - '24.0'\n      - '74.9'\n      - '0.3'\n      - '0'\n      - '11.8'\n      - '0'\n    - - Qwen 8B\n      - Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '21.1'\n      - '13.4'\n      - '14.1'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - Unc.\n      - '10.5'\n      - '88.8'\n      - '0.1'\n      - '0'\n      - '5.7'\n      - '0'\n    - - Llama 8B\n      - Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '3.8'\n      - '17.2'\n      - '7.5'\n      - '17.6'\n    - - Mistral 7B\n      - Unc.\n      - '37.3'\n      - '63.9'\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '2.4'\n      - '0'\n    - - Mistral 7B\n      - Full S1\n      - '0'\n      - '0'\n      - '1.3'\n      - '14.9'\n      - '3.9'\n      - '11.7'\n    - - Mistral 7B\n      - Grammar\n      - '0'\n      - '64.0'\n      - '13.8'\n      - '1.1'\n      - '3.4'\n      - '11.9'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 (Intro/Method): Architecture diagram — ontology schema → compiler →\n    grammar CFG + semantic TypeConstraintProcessor → bitwise AND → constrained LLM\n    decoding。标注 enabling dependency arrow from grammar to semantic。'\n  - 'Figure 2 (§3 Violation Landscape): Heatmap of per-relation DR by model (SciERC\n    7 relations + DocRED top-10 relations)。Color intensity = violation rate，with tightness\n    τ̄ annotated per relation。'\n  - 'Figure 3 (§5 Results): DR reduction waterfall across settings (Unconstrained\n    → Grammar → Semantic → Full S1)，4-panel grid for SciERC/DocRED × Qwen/Llama。'\n  - 'Figure 4 (§5.4 EE): Stacked violation bar chart for WikiEvents (3 models × unc/grammar/S1)。Visual\n    dominance of RoV in unconstrained，clean elimination in Full S1。'\n  - 'Figure 5 (§5.5 or Appendix): Scale-neutral pattern plot — 8B vs 70B，DR and R-F1\n    delta，confirming model-size-invariance。'\n  analysis: Best tier paper 的 table/figure 密度目标是 ~1 table + ~1 figure per page (8\n    pages)。 4 tables + 5 figures = 9 visual elements 在 8 页正文中偏满——建议将 beam sweep 和\n    prompt sensitivity tables 移入 appendix，正文保留 3 tables + 4 figures。\n","numLines":1228,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1228}}}
