vs unconstrained, extending 70B SciERC results to DocRED and confirming scale-independent constraint effectiveness across datasets\\\\n- **d066_sweep_llama_beam8_unc** (success): d066 DocRED beam sweep sub-task: Llama beam8 unconstrained on 200-doc subset (westd-16980 GPU1). Part of d066_beam_sweep parent experiment. ← 基于 d066_beam_sweep\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 111 / 负向 7 / 失败 11 / 共 133\\\\nCF_pct: 0 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\nDR_pct: 1.5 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-16980: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-21461: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- w1_cf_fallback_docred: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- w1_cf_fallback_llama_scierc: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- w1_cf_fallback_llama_docred: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- w9_qwen_docred_zs_sampling: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- p8b_docred_latency: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability_r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability_r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- p1_ee_ft_composability_r4: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- p1_ee_ft_llama: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- d064_docred_full_beam: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- d066_docred_beam_sweep: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- d065_qwen_greedy_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- d066_sweep_llama_scierc_beam1_unc: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2778, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WagjXkAJm4i9yzp9ydK3QT","session_id":"5cda2c76-b1bb-4b5e-b780-c4d3c1c78b32","uuid":"15e14280-3a69-40e6-8756-faf6e416b7b8","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:26:17.186Z"}
